  "description": "The process of selecting political representatives or leaders through voting. In the context of the meme, it refers to the electoral process in the United States, which is a central mechanism of democratic governance. The phrase 'when it comes to elections' implies that the 'America First' principle is being applied specifically to electoral politics, suggesting a focus on domestic political outcomes over international considerations.",
